# Frontend env. Copy to frontend/.env.local only when overriding these defaults.
# Unset values use the browser's current host: HTTP -> backend port 8000;
# HTTPS -> same-origin /api and /ws (requires a reverse proxy).
# A phone visiting http://YOUR-LAN-IP:3000 will then reach YOUR-LAN-IP:8000.
# Set all three variables for production or separate-host deployments.
# Anything exposed to the browser MUST be prefixed NEXT_PUBLIC_.

# NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=https://api.example.org
# NEXT_PUBLIC_WS_BASE_URL=wss://api.example.org
# NEXT_PUBLIC_JOIN_BASE_URL=https://captions.example.org
